  "body": "(I haven't thoroughly validated this claim, but didn't want to lose it so thought it'd be better making an issue.)\r\n\r\n#11174 appears to allow changing user types via the admin API. This includes changing whether a user is a support user or not. (Support users are excluded from the user directory.)\r\n\r\nThe PR does not appear to add any handling (or tests) that includes/excludes the changed user in/from the user directory.\r\n\r\n(cc @DMRobertson since you've been working on the user directory)",
